WARNING! WARNING WILL ROBINSON!  SINK SPOILERS AHEAD!!!






































You can (q)uaff from sinks and have a wide variety of things happend to you. 
Anything from summoning snakes/Water Elementals/Water Nymphs, to finding rings,
to being polymorphed, to gaining intrinsics, or even creating a fountain.

You can (k)ick sinks and have either a)nothing happens, b)summon a Succubus,
c)summon a Black Pudding, or d)find a ring (provided a ring has not yet been
found in this sink).

You can (d)rop a ring into a sink and depending on the effect, identify the
ring;  however, there is a 95% chance of losing the ring.

